 your endurance and see how long you can make it in endless mode!<br></li><li> <strong>Gonzo Monsters</strong><br>Over 24 varied monsters from shapeshifting skinwalkers to lumbering trolls!<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Upgrades</strong><br>Over 24 upgrades with novel interactions for different monster archetypes.</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.poster.avif?t=1734152288\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.webm?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/extras/8b7d4346285b1efc44d9b680c6e6cc69.mp4?t=1734152288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Monster Bullets is a first-person roguelite where each monster has a specific weakness. Quickly load the correct bullet for each monster and fire them off! Experiment with upgrades on each procedurally generated attempt and try to slay the goblin king!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/header.jpg?t=1734152288", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734152288", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734152288", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5, AMD Ryzen or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gr